      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2524613102,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Please check definition in radiotap page:\nhttps://www.radiotap.org/fields/S1G.html\nThe S1G NDP specific fields are not pushed and approved.\nThis is also vendor specific implementation.\nIf you want to restore in Wireshark, you need to have review in radiotap definition.",
